[req.181656]
title = "Protocol TVL displays preserve the snapshot's six-decimal USDL unit contract"
ac_1 = "Given custody transfers of 5000000 in and 1500000 out, the raw aggregate snapshot remains 3500000 as asserted at services/platform/perps-data/internal/store/projections_test.go:556 and returned at services/platform/perps-data/internal/graphql/perps.go:1727, and both the card conversion at apps/perps/src/widgets/analytics/AnalyticsLiquidStat.tsx:54 and chart conversion at apps/perps/src/widgets/analytics/ProtocolTvlChart.tsx:66 display 3.5 dollars rather than 3.5e-12."
ac_2 = "Given complete aggregate snapshots with fractional six-decimal amounts and a positive baseline exactly 24 hours earlier, the card reports the correct daily percentage; empty, malformed, missing, mistimed or zero-baseline history retains the unavailable behavior at apps/perps/src/widgets/analytics/AnalyticsLiquidStat.tsx:185, and unchanged collateral remains included as asserted at apps/perps/tests/repair-22-33-192.test.ts:227."
ac_3 = "The TVL unit description at apps/perps/src/types/perps.ts:119 and source statement at apps/perps/src/widgets/analytics/repair-22-33-192.kvx:7 agree with the raw six-decimal custody sum, and the GraphQL-to-card and chart regression uses 3500000 from the existing producer assertion instead of the WAD fixture at apps/perps/tests/repair-22-33-192.test.ts:103."

